Z||000004||ChadMan||02-11-2000||08:54 AM||||There's something special about a black aero notchback!  I almost bought a black SE three years ago.  It was super clean inside and out and drove great.  Plus it had the glossiest black paint you ever saw - if Darth Vader drove a Fiero, it would be this SE.  Seemed like it might need a clutch before long, though, and the guy wouldn't come down from $3700.<P>Oh well - it probably wouldn't have been as reliable as my Coupe anyway.  I'll just keep on telling myself that.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
